00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:21.483
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:23.970
- Yeah so we went out to Catalina

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.905
and I had a diamond in my, the

00:00:25.905 --> 00:00:28.050
you know that little pocket on your jeans?

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:28.891
- Oh the tiny, tiny one?

00:00:28.891 --> 00:00:30.260
- I had the diamond
ring, yeah, and of course

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.200
this is the most expensive
thing I'd ever had,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.320
was in my jeans pocket.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.770
Other than like a Saab 900S in the 80s.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.840
So, I was real

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:45.930
