00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.153
- Oh no!

00:00:57.153 --> 00:00:57.986
- Yeah.

00:00:57.986 --> 00:00:59.043
Yeah, and she was super surprised.

00:00:59.043 --> 00:01:00.530
- Wait, do people bring people to

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:01.820
