00:01:02.653 --> 00:01:03.486
- Yeah.

00:01:03.486 --> 00:01:04.637
- And then my next
thought was she was like,

00:01:04.637 --> 00:01:05.960
"Oh this is great news."

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:06.793
She started crying.

00:01:06.793 --> 00:01:07.626
She's like, "This is great

00:01:07.626 --> 00:01:09.020
cause I thought we were breaking up."

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:09.853
- Oh my God.

00:01:09.853 --> 00:01:11.926
- And I was like, "If I
brought you to an island

00:01:11.926 --> 00:01:13.750
(crowd laughs)

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:17.493
to the top of a hill, that's
like what Dr.Evil would do.

00:01:18.921 --> 00:01:20.147
Mwahaha.

00:01:20.147 --> 00:01:22.851
- You're either gonna
propose or bury someone.

00:01:22.851 --> 00:01:24.450
- Yeah of course.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.216
Look down the hill.

00:01:26.216 --> 00:01:27.266
- It's fine.

00:01:27.266 --> 00:01:28.183
- Surprise.

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.420
- How did Ozzie propose to you?

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.924
- Oh, he asked my father permission first.

00:01:33.924 --> 00:01:34.840
Yeah he did.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.780
- What a gentleman.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:39.050
- Yeah and then he went
out and got me a ring,

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:42.540
but he got me a wedding
ring, not an engagement ring.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:46.670
So, he bent down, he gave me
the ring, and it was lovely.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:49.500
And then, the next week
we had a huge fight.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.580
I took the ring off.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.380
I threw it into the bushes.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.240
- A very passionate relationship.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.870
- Oh, yes, and then all
I see is my husband's bum

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:01.629
as he's on the ground looking
for the ring in the bushes.

00:02:01.629 --> 00:02:02.462
- Did he find it?

00:02:02.462 --> 00:02:03.295
- Yeah, he did.

00:02:03.295 --> 00:02:04.128
- Good.

00:02:04.128 --> 00:02:05.353
- 37 years later, it worked.

